                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>When is edge AI worth the complexity?</h3>
                                        <p>When latency must be sub-100ms, when connectivity is unreliable, when privacy prohibits cloud, or when scale makes cloud inference cost-prohibitive.</p>
                                        <h3>Which hardware for edge AI?</h3>
                                        <p>NVIDIA Jetson for most workloads. Google Coral for TFLite. Custom silicon only at high volumes.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does edge AI cost?</h3>
                                        <p>PoC: ₹8-25 lakh ($10K-30K). Production single use case: ₹25-90 lakh ($30K-108K). Enterprise: ₹1-4 Cr ($120K-480K). Plus hardware per edge unit.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I run LLMs at the edge?</h3>
                                        <p>Small LLMs (Llama 3.2 1B / 3B, Phi 3) yes, on Jetson Orin or newer phones. Full-size LLMs still cloud-only.</p>
